[18.540224, "o", "## Decisions in force (1)\r\n\r\nEach was accepted, and none of them superseded. For the argument behind one, ask\r\n`read_record` for its id.\r\nEach line ends with the day it was accepted and whether an agent accepted it or no agent was declared.\r\nThe identity is mnid:3f385619, unless a line names another.\r\n0 of them were accepted by an agent and 1 with no agent declared.\r\n\r\nNo other decision recorded here is awaiting a judgement.\r\n\r\n- **ADR-1: Keep money as integer cents** · `01a1ff79-f3bd-7000-9982-15e2f5e26a9b` · 2026-11-21 · no agent declared\r\n"]
[20.742827, "o", "\u001b[2m# and what the record can prove about itself: no key, no network\u001b[0m\r\n"]
